    "created_at": "2015-10-29T12:26:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-29T12:29:57Z",
    "body": "There are two options here.\n1. Modify the resource selection algorithm so that it calls the resource fetch algorithm with a media provider object if the URL scheme is \"blob\".\n2. Modify the resource fetch algorithm so that if changes the mode to local if the URL scheme is \"blob\".\n\nI think I will try option 2.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
