    "created_at": "2015-10-29T12:52:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-29T12:52:04Z",
    "body": "Or 4. When assigning a \"blob\" URL to the `src` attribute, dereference it and, if that results in a `MediaStream`, `MediaSource` or `Blob`, behave as if that object was assigned to `srcObject`.\n\nSomething would have to be done about `<source>` elements, most likely not supporting \"blob\" URLs at all in that context, which is unlikely to be a problem.\n",
