    "created_at": "2015-10-29T15:27:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-29T15:27:55Z",
    "body": "It seems slightly weird to not support blob URLs in `<source>`, although I suppose there isn't much of a use case for having it since you can just use `canPlayType` instead and then assign the appropriate blob URL to `src`.\n",
